-- Q853: Privacy Requirements and Data Protection [hard/L2]
-- Issues: #3
UPDATE questions SET
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (C): Under HIPAA''s Breach Notification Rule (45 CFR Section 164.404-164.408), breaches affecting 500 or more individuals require notification to affected individuals, the Department of Health and Human Services, and prominent media outlets serving the affected jurisdiction. Since 1,000 records exceeds the 500-person threshold, all three notification obligations apply.
